 "Setup checks dependencies and rendering (D-001–D-003). The CSV supplies deliveries; JSON reconstructs initial XIs (D-004). Reference names and regular innings define the cleaned history (D-005).", "", table_md(rr("data_quality")), "",
 "Historical features use earlier dates and cold-start shrinkage; completed-season finals define the split (D-006–D-007).", "", table_md(rr("split_summary")), "", table_md(rr("leakage_audit")), "",
 "Training-only exploration motivates venue and season context (D-008). Rolling-origin assessment compares raw selection procedures before interaction and polynomial candidates enter validation (D-009).", "", table_md(rr("rolling_cv_summary")), "",
 "Training PCA and ML factor models analyse batting, bowling and combined blocks (D-010). Frozen venue profiles produce compact categories (D-011).", "", table_md(rr("dimension_checks")), "", table_md(rr("cluster_summary")), "",
 "Influence flags trigger sensitivity comparisons, and variance remedies are assessed rather than assumed effective (D-012–D-013).", "", table_md(rr("heteroscedasticity_tests")), "",
 "Validation freezes the final choice before test outcomes are scored (D-014).", "", table_md(rr("final_selection")), "", table_md(rr("test_metrics")), "", table_md(rr("interval_summary")), "",
 "Read the learning guide first, the HTML report next, and the talk track when preparing to present.")
